Package: RRHFD
Type: Package
Title: Robust Rolling Hotelling T-Squared Fault Detection
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Hasan", "Bulut", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "hasan@example.com")
  )
Description: A small implementation of the adaptive robust rolling Hotelling
    T-squared fault detection method used in the Stochastic Hotelling T2
    project. The package computes adaptive MCD alpha values, robust rolling
    Hotelling statistics, empirical thresholds, online alarms, and basic
    fault-detection metrics. It can use robustbase::covMcd() when available,
    and otherwise falls back to a simple trimmed robust covariance estimator.
